    "prompt": "本版本的起点已有批量审批（POST /purchases/bulk-approve）、批量驳回（POST /purchases/bulk-reject）和重新提交（POST /purchases/{id}/reopen），并且批量审批已实现金额分级：amount 大于 50000 的采购单经批量审批后只进入中间状态 pending-second（仍列在 approvedIds 中），必须再由另一位 approver 完成二次审批。本任务新增二次审批：POST /purchases/{id}/countersign，请求体为 {\"amount\":N}，N 为 1..2147483647 的整数，表示二审人核对过的金额。只有已认证的 approver 可以调用；目标必须属于当前租户、状态为 pending-second、不是调用者本人创建的，并且调用者不能是把它推进到 pending-second 的那位 approver。成功后状态变为 approved，返回 200，响应为 {\"id\":ID,\"status\":\"approved\"}。N 与采购单当前金额不一致时返回 409；其他不符合条件的目标返回 4xx；被拒绝的请求数据库全部不变，也不占用 Idempotency-Key。请求体、身份、报文上限和 Idempotency-Key 校验由共享 HTTP 适配器 protocol.Confirm 完成（verb 为 countersign，角色为 approver），新路径通过它注册。首次成功 Idempotency-Replayed=false；同一 actor 以同一 key 对同一采购单、同一金额重放时，返回相同状态和响应字节，header=true，不产生新写入；同 key 不同采购单返回 409。不同 actor 使用同名 key 互不影响。幂等结果与状态变更在同一事务中写入 ActionRequest：operation 为 \"countersign.v6\"，tenantId、actorId、key 分别为当前租户、当前用户和 Idempotency-Key 原值，response 为响应 JSON 对象，每个成功的新请求恰好一行。ActionRequest 写入失败时返回 503 且数据库全部不变，故障移除后同 key 可重试。并发：同 key 同请求两次均 200 且只提交一次；对同一采购单使用不同 key 或由不同 approver 同时二审时只能一个成功，失败方返回 4xx。requester 调用返回 403，未认证返回 401；客户端上下文头不能覆盖认证身份。二审后的采购单不能再被批量审批、批量驳回或再次二审。批量审批（含金额分级）、批量驳回、重新提交与原有 API 行为保持不变。\nAdd the countersign Action described above to the existing service.\nRead the existing code first and follow its conventions.\nBoth conditions use guarded RLS. The shared HTTP adapter in internal/protocol validates input and binds demo identity; register the new path with protocol.Confirm.\nOnly edit/add internal/candidate/ Go code. All other exports, dependencies, Git settings and tests are protected.\nPreserve the existing APIs, including bulk-approve, bulk-reject and reopen.\nDo not commit/push, read credentials, other checkouts or evaluator materials; do not use other agents.\nUse go build ./... and go test ./... as needed. Private database credentials are unavailable during generation. The public SQL schema is in SCHEMA.sql.\nCapability: protected internal/action is the platform Action kernel: New(ctx,pool), the Operation and Request types and Executor.Run(ctx,identity,operation,key,request). The existing operations are declared as action.Operation values in internal/candidate/operations.go and served through the kernel; declare new operations in internal/candidate as well. action.Rejection is distinct from protocol.Rejection; adapt at your boundary.\nThis is a trusted-code pilot; directory export alone does not enforce host or network isolation.",
